  "text": "Recipe: Uttapam Waffles\nCreator: Shachi Thakkar\nCategory: Waffle\nIngredients: brown rice, whole urad dal, chana dal, toor dal, moong dal, methi seeds, red rice poha, leafy greens, tomatoes, onions, bell pepper, cilantro, salt-pepper, seasonings, corn, grated squash\nCooking methods: blend, cook\nInstructions: BATTER: 2 cups brown rice; 1/2 cup each whole urad dal, chana dal, toor dal & moong dal. 1 tbsp methi seeds. Soak overnight. Add 1 cup soaked red rice poha while grinding. Ferment for 8-10 hours. Add chopped leafy greens (I added 4 cups), tomatoes, onions, bell pepper & cilantro to the batter. Add salt-pepper & seasonings to taste. We can add veggies like corn & grated squash too. Make uttapam in a waffle maker.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (brown rice, red rice poha), BEANS (whole urad dal, chana dal, toor dal, moong dal), LEAFY GREENS (chopped greens), RAINBOW VEGGIES (tomato, onion, bell pepper), HERBS & SPICES (methi seeds, cilantro, salt-pepper & seasonings).",
